---
// Real public contact paths, without an invented office or response-time promise.
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { whatsappDisplay, whatsappUrl } from "@/data/contact";
import "@/styles/services.css";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact Porul.in — Services, Editorial & Corrections" description="Contact Porul.in by WhatsApp or email about MSME benefits reviews, GeM support, editorial enquiries or corrections. Scope and any fee are confirmed first." breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", path: "/" }, { name: "Contact", path: "/contact/" }]}>
  <div class="service-page"><section class="service-intro"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Contact Porul.in</p><h1>Start a conversation with Porul.</h1><p class="intro-copy">For services, editorial questions and corrections, use the contact paths below. Porul.in is an independent service provider and publication, not a government body.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button--dark" href={whatsappUrl()}>WhatsApp {whatsappDisplay}</a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@porul.in">hello@porul.in</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="service-band"><div class="wrap service-split"><div><h2>Service enquiries</h2><p>For an MSME benefits review, tell us what you manufacture, your district and state, and whether you are planning, producing or expanding. Benefits reviews cover businesses in Tamil Nadu and Karnataka. Read the <a href="/msme-benefits/">review scope and limits</a> before enquiring. We confirm scope and any fee before an assessment begins.</p><p>For GeM registration or catalogue help, share your product and current portal stage. For a bid or Tamil Nadu tender, include the official link and deadline so we can review whether we can help. An enquiry is not a booking, an eligibility decision or a guarantee of approval.</p><p><a href="/enquire/">Prepare an enquiry message</a>. Nothing is sent until you choose a channel and send it yourself. Please do not send identity numbers, bank documents, passwords or OTPs in an initial message. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p></div><div><h2>Editorial &amp; corrections</h2><p>Send story enquiries to <a href="mailto:hello@porul.in?subject=Editorial%20enquiry">hello@porul.in with the subject “Editorial enquiry”</a>. Paid services do not purchase editorial coverage or endorsement.</p><p>To request a correction, send the article link, the claim in question and supporting evidence to <a href="mailto:hello@porul.in?subject=Correction%20request">hello@porul.in with the subject “Correction request”</a>. Each request is reviewed and answered with the change made or the reason no change was made. Read our <a href="/about/#editorial-standards">editorial standards</a>.</p><p>For The Room, use its <a href="/the-room/">application process and four fit questions</a>. It is not a sourcing or sales-enquiry channel. Service enquiries belong in the service contact path above.</p></div></div></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
